/// Regenerates `assets/schema/gamedata_110.json` from a local
/// `GameDataList.Product.110.byml`.
///
/// Usage:
///   dart run tool/gen_schema.dart `<GameDataList.Product.110.byml>`
///
/// The tool is standalone: it imports `dart:convert`, `dart:io`,
/// `dart:typed_data`, and the package's pure-Dart Murmur3 implementation. It
/// writes one compact JSON document to stdout. It never reads a `.sav` file at
/// run time: the verified record-key order from the three samples is embedded
/// below as `_recordOrderBase64`.
///
/// The byml stores only Murmur3 hashes for field names. `_nameTable` is the
/// verified hash -> name table recovered from the game's string tables, the
/// Longshot host constants, and the byml's own struct-member defaults. Every
/// line is checked with Murmur3 before the field is emitted; an unmatched name
/// is never guessed. Unnamed fields are emitted with `"name": null` and are
/// counted in `unresolved`.
///
/// Reproducibility: same byml bytes + same tool -> byte-identical stdout.
